---
import SeasonBadge from "../components/SeasonBadge.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="2026-2027 Standings"
  description="The current live, independently operated National Points Race for extemporaneous speaking."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero-grid">
      <div>
        <SeasonBadge classification="Current live race" />
        <p class="eyebrow season-line">2026-2027 season</p>
        <h1>The race is live again.</h1>
        <p class="dek">
          A transparent, autonomous National Points Race for high school
          extemporaneous speaking, independently operated by Saras Totey.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="/2026-27/">Open current season</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/methodology/">See how points work</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="paper-card season-card" aria-label="Current season state">
        <p class="eyebrow">Season state</p>
        <strong>Initialized</strong>
        <p>
          The 20-tournament ledger is ready. Standings begin when permitted final
          results from the first tracked event are available.
        </p>
        <ul class="meta-list">
          <li><span>Policy</span><b>legacy-2024-25-v1</b></li>
          <li><span>Tracked lineages</span><b>20</b></li>
          <li><span>Publication</span><b>Audited versions</b></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Three records, one transparent archive</p><h2>Know what you are reading.</h2></div>
        <p>
          Original results remain original. The missing season is reconstructed and
          labeled. The current race is independently operated and live.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-grid">
        <article class="paper-card">
          <SeasonBadge classification="Extemp Central official archive" />
          <h3>2008-09 through 2024-25</h3>
          <p>Ten completed seasons preserved with attribution and original source links.</p>
          <a href="/archive/">Browse the archive</a>
        </article>
        <article class="paper-card">
          <SeasonBadge classification="Automated reconstruction" />
          <h3>2025-26 proof season</h3>
          <p>A retrospective system test using only permitted official public evidence.</p>
          <a href="/2025-26/">Review the reconstruction</a>
        </article>
        <article class="paper-card">
          <SeasonBadge classification="Current live race" />
          <h3>2026-27 current NPR</h3>
          <p>Autonomous collection, conservative identity resolution, and versioned scoring.</p>
          <a href="/2026-27/">Follow the current race</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell split-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Built for verification</p>
        <h2>Every point should have a receipt.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The system preserves official source snapshots, normalizes results,
          withholds ambiguous identities, applies the frozen policy, and publishes a
          deterministic version hash. Corrections create a new version without erasing
          the old one.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/methodology/">Read the complete methodology</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .season-line { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .season-card > strong {
    color: var(--burgundy);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }
  .season-card li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .season-card li span { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .paper-card h3 { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
</style>
